#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""FS3 v162 - steering, flight, top bar, wreckage, escorts.

    Inertia   the player's ship speeds up and slows down at the rate of its
              class (nimble 0.2 s to full speed, heavy 0.42 s), glides a
              little and does not overshoot the pointer.
    Keys      WASD no longer flies the ship (S opens the settings); the
              arrow keys still do. The top bar buttons that open a window
              show their key: V, R, S.
    Tickets   the glow lies round what is drawn (it ran under the destroyer
              icon); a wide icon is fitted into its cell.
    Fighters  turns build up and die away, speed changes gradually, runs go
              in beside the target and carry on past it, wingmen keep a slot
              by their leader, a fighter that is hit jinks sideways.
    Capitals  their patrol drift turns round softly ahead of the lane's end.
    Wreckage  wreckage and rammers take a share of at most 500 hull from a
              capital ship, not of the whole hull (M35: the defector Deimos
              lost more to the wrecks of her attackers than to their guns).
    Escorts   leave alone what is to be taken, disabled or scanned first
              (the Faustus in M46, the Arcadia in M51).

Needs v161. Edits src/30_waves.js, src/40_world.js, src/50_combat.js,
src/55_arms.js, src/57_turrets.js, src/60_effects.js and src/70_ui.js in
place, and writes the updated fieldsim.js and ramsim.js. Run assemble.py
afterwards.
"""
